    },
    "In Tailscale's admin console, under Settings, Keys, generate an auth key. Then in TrueNAS open Apps, choose Discover Apps, install Tailscale, enter the auth key and a hostname, and tick Userspace." : {
      "comment" : "Seerr guide: Tailscale on TrueNAS",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opret en auth-nøgle i Tailscales administrationskonsol under Settings, Keys. Åbn derefter Apps i TrueNAS, vælg Discover Apps, installer Tailscale, indtast auth-nøglen og et værtsnavn, og sæt flueben ved Userspace."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erzeuge in der Tailscale-Admin-Konsole unter Settings, Keys einen Auth-Key. Öffne dann in TrueNAS Apps, wähle Discover Apps, installiere Tailscale, gib den Auth-Key und einen Hostnamen ein und aktiviere Userspace."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En la consola de administración de Tailscale, en Settings, Keys, genera una clave de autenticación. Luego, en TrueNAS, abre Apps, elige Discover Apps, instala Tailscale, escribe la clave de autenticación y un nombre de host, y marca Userspace."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Luo Tailscalen hallintakonsolissa kohdassa Settings, Keys todennusavain. Avaa sitten TrueNASissa Apps, valitse Discover Apps, asenna Tailscale, anna todennusavain ja isäntänimi ja rastita Userspace."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans la console d’administration de Tailscale, sous Settings, Keys, générez une clé d’authentification. Puis, dans TrueNAS, ouvrez Apps, choisissez Discover Apps, installez Tailscale, saisissez la clé d’authentification et un nom d’hôte, et cochez Userspace."
          }
        },
        "is" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Í Tailscale-stjórnborðinu, undir Settings og Keys, býrðu til auðkenningarlykil. Opnaðu svo Apps í TrueNAS, veldu Discover Apps, settu upp Tailscale, sláðu inn auðkenningarlykilinn og hýsilheiti og hakaðu við Userspace."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nella console di amministrazione di Tailscale, in Settings, Keys, genera una chiave di autenticazione. Poi in TrueNAS apri Apps, scegli Discover Apps, installa Tailscale, inserisci la chiave di autenticazione e un nome host, e spunta Userspace."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tailscale の管理コンソールで、Settings、Keys の順に開き、認証キーを生成します。次に TrueNAS で Apps を開き、Discover Apps を選んで Tailscale をインストールします。認証キーとホスト名を入力し、Userspace にチェックを入れます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tailscale 관리 콘솔에서 Settings, Keys로 들어가 인증 키를 만드세요. 그다음 TrueNAS에서 Apps를 열고 Discover Apps를 선택한 뒤 Tailscale을 설치하세요. 인증 키와 호스트 이름을 입력하고 Userspace를 체크하세요."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I Tailscales administrasjonskonsoll, under Settings, Keys, generer en auth-nøkkel. Åpne deretter Apps i TrueNAS, velg Discover Apps, installer Tailscale, skriv inn auth-nøkkelen og et vertsnavn, og kryss av for Userspace."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "W konsoli administracyjnej Tailscale wejdź w Settings, Keys i wygeneruj klucz uwierzytelniania. Potem w TrueNAS otwórz Apps, wybierz Discover Apps, zainstaluj Tailscale, wpisz klucz uwierzytelniania i nazwę hosta, a następnie zaznacz Userspace."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No console de administração do Tailscale, em Settings, Keys, gere uma chave de autenticação. Depois, no TrueNAS, abra Apps, escolha Discover Apps, instale o Tailscale, informe a chave de autenticação e um nome de host, e marque Userspace."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skapa en autentiseringsnyckel i Tailscales adminkonsol under Settings, Keys. Öppna sedan Apps i TrueNAS, välj Discover Apps, installera Tailscale, ange autentiseringsnyckeln och ett värdnamn och bocka för Userspace."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Tailscale 的管理控制台中，依次进入 Settings、Keys，生成一个身份验证密钥。然后在 TrueNAS 中打开 Apps，选择 Discover Apps，安装 Tailscale，填入该身份验证密钥和一个主机名，并勾选 Userspace。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Tailscale 的管理主控台中，於「Settings」、「Keys」下產生驗證金鑰。然後在 TrueNAS 中開啟「Apps」，選擇「Discover Apps」，安裝 Tailscale，輸入驗證金鑰和主機名稱，並勾選「Userspace」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In TrueNAS, open Apps, choose Discover Apps, search for Seerr and install it. Keep its web port at 5055, which is where Crucible looks." : {
      "comment" : "Seerr guide: TrueNAS install",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Åbn Apps i TrueNAS, vælg Discover Apps, søg efter Seerr og installer det. Behold webporten 5055, som Crucible søger efter."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffne in TrueNAS Apps, wähle Discover Apps, suche nach Seerr und installiere es. Behalte den Web-Port 5055, unter dem Crucible nach ihm sucht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En TrueNAS, abre Apps, elige Discover Apps, busca Seerr e instálalo. Deja su puerto web en 5055, que es donde busca Crucible."
