            "value" : "在 Plex 電腦和這台 Apple TV 上安裝 Tailscale，並登入同一個帳號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Tailscale's own package, not the older one in Package Center. Then in Control Panel, Task Scheduler, create a Triggered Task that runs as root at boot-up with this command, so Tailscale keeps working after a restart:" : {
      "comment" : "Seerr guide: Tailscale on Synology",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installer Tailscales egen pakke, ikke den ældre i Package Center. Opret derefter i Control Panel under Task Scheduler en Triggered Task, der kører som root ved opstart med denne kommando, så Tailscale fortsat virker efter en genstart:"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installiere das eigene Paket von Tailscale, nicht das ältere aus dem Package Center. Erstelle dann in Control Panel unter Task Scheduler eine Triggered Task, die als root beim Hochfahren mit diesem Befehl läuft, damit Tailscale nach einem Neustart weiter funktioniert:"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instala el paquete propio de Tailscale, no el más antiguo de Package Center. Luego, en Control Panel, Task Scheduler, crea una Triggered Task que se ejecute como root al arrancar con este comando, para que Tailscale siga funcionando tras un reinicio:"
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Asenna Tailscalen oma paketti, älä vanhempaa Package Centeristä. Luo sitten Control Panelin Task Schedulerissa Triggered Task, joka ajaa tämän komennon käyttäjänä root käynnistyksen yhteydessä, jotta Tailscale toimii uudelleenkäynnistyksen jälkeen:"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installez le paquet propre à Tailscale, et non l’ancienne version du Package Center. Puis, dans Control Panel, Task Scheduler, créez une Triggered Task qui s’exécute en root au démarrage avec cette commande, pour que Tailscale continue de fonctionner après un redémarrage :"
          }
        },
        "is" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Settu upp eigin pakka Tailscale, ekki eldri pakkann í Package Center. Búðu síðan til Triggered Task í Control Panel, Task Scheduler, sem keyrir sem root við ræsingu með þessari skipun, svo að Tailscale virki áfram eftir endurræsingu:"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installa il pacchetto ufficiale di Tailscale, non quello più vecchio in Package Center. Poi in Control Panel, Task Scheduler, crea un Triggered Task che viene eseguito come root all'avvio con questo comando, così Tailscale continua a funzionare dopo un riavvio:"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Package Center にある古いものではなく、Tailscale 専用のパッケージをインストールします。次に Control Panel の Task Scheduler で、起動時に root として実行される Triggered Task を作成します。再起動後も Tailscale が動き続けるように、次のコマンドを設定します："
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Package Center의 예전 패키지가 아니라 Tailscale 전용 패키지를 설치하세요. 그다음 Control Panel, Task Scheduler에서 Triggered Task를 만드세요. 부팅할 때 root 권한으로 아래 명령을 실행하도록 설정해야 재시작 후에도 Tailscale이 계속 작동해요:"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installer Tailscales egen pakke, ikke den eldre i Package Center. Opprett deretter i Control Panel, Task Scheduler, en Triggered Task som kjører som root ved oppstart med denne kommandoen, slik at Tailscale fortsetter å fungere etter en omstart:"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zainstaluj własny pakiet Tailscale, a nie starszy z Package Center. Potem w Control Panel, Task Scheduler utwórz Triggered Task, który uruchamia się jako root przy starcie systemu, z tym poleceniem, aby Tailscale działał po ponownym uruchomieniu:"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instale o pacote próprio do Tailscale, não o mais antigo do Package Center. Depois, no Control Panel, Task Scheduler, crie uma Triggered Task que execute como root na inicialização, com este comando, para que o Tailscale continue funcionando depois de reiniciar:"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installera Tailscales egna paket, inte det äldre i Package Center. Skapa sedan i Control Panel under Task Scheduler en Triggered Task som körs som root vid uppstart med det här kommandot, så att Tailscale fortsätter fungera efter en omstart:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请安装 Tailscale 自己的套件，而不是 Package Center 中较旧的那个。然后在 Control Panel 的 Task Scheduler 中，创建一个 Triggered Task，设定为开机时以 root 身份运行以下命令，这样 Tailscale 在重新启动后仍能正常工作："
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安裝 Tailscale 自己的套件，不要安裝套件中心裡較舊的版本。接著到「控制台」中的 Task Scheduler，建立一個 Triggered Task，讓它以 root 身分在開機時執行下列指令，這樣重新開機後 Tailscale 仍能持續運作："
          }
        }
      }
    },
