    "Trakt's own Plex sync is on. If both record, every episode counts twice. Pick one." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the double-scrobble question",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trakts egen Plex-sync er slået til. Hvis begge registrerer, tæller hvert afsnit dobbelt. Vælg én."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
