    "With Crucible Pro, Statistics counts everything Trakt knows you watched, not only Plex." : {
      "comment" : "Trakt benefit detail: Everything in Statistics",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
